   168	/**
   169	 * Escape width table for non-printable code points (Python uses lowercase hex):
   170	 *   cp < 0x100    -> \xNN
   171	 *   cp < 0x10000  -> \uNNNN
   172	 *   otherwise     -> \UNNNNNNNN
   173	 */
